            ],
            "text": "To log in to your **Wells Fargo credit card account**, use the official Wells Fargo sign-on page:\n\n**Go to:** `wellsfargo.com` \u2192 click **Sign On**  \nOr use the official Wells Fargo Online sign-on page for personal accounts. ([login-ed.com](https://login-ed.com/wells-fargo-credit-card-page?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Safety tip:** Don\u2019t use third-party \u201clogin\u201d pages from search results. Type **wellsfargo.com** directly into your browser or use the Wells Fargo mobile app.\n\nIf you\u2019re logging in for the first time, choose **Enroll** to create Wells Fargo Online access. Wells Fargo says online account management lets cardholders access/pay bills, set alerts, and view statements. ([retailservices.wellsfargo.com](https://retailservices.wellsfargo.com/locator/WFHA?utm_source=openai))",
